WEBVTT

00:06:30.233 --> 00:06:33.184
It was in a circle session
that my life took a turn.

00:06:33.208 --> 00:06:35.565
I remember being asked who I was,

00:06:35.589 --> 00:06:37.010
and I didn't have an answer,

00:06:37.913 --> 00:06:39.771
at least not one that felt honest

00:06:39.795 --> 00:06:42.837
in a room full of men
who were seeking truth.

00:06:42.861 --> 00:06:44.604
It would have been easy to say,

00:06:44.628 --> 00:06:46.340
"I'm a Blood,"

00:06:46.364 --> 00:06:48.596
or, "My name is Vegas,"

00:06:49.396 --> 00:06:52.784
or any number of facades
I had manufactured to hide behind.

00:06:53.651 --> 00:06:57.762
It was in that moment and in that venue
that the jig was up.

00:06:59.362 --> 00:07:01.775
I realized that as sharp
as I believed I was,